WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.960
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: no telling “yo mama”

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:05.960
jokes!

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.269
These include, but are not limited to: “Yo
mama’s so ugly, SCP-096 is afraid to look

00:00:10.269 --> 00:00:11.269
at HER!”

00:00:11.269 --> 00:00:14.269
“Yo mama’s so gross, she made SCP-049
sick!”

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:18.770
And “Yo mama’s so toxic, she made SCP-682
keel over and die!”

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:24.250
Not only was this style of joke already outdated
a decade ago, but they’re just unnecessarily

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.430
mean!

